  "provisions": [
    {
      "anchor": "art_1",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_1",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 1",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting authorities shall use, for the publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union* of the notices referred to in Articles 48, 49, 50, 72, 75 and 79 of Directive 2014/24/EU, the standard forms set out in Annexes I, II, III, VIII to XI, XVII and XVIII to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "35d49f71b027373dcd4320ce9794840b7e57b486743eb64b00350736be148efa",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 715,
        "end": 1004
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_2",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_2",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 2",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting entities shall use, for the publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union* of the notices referred to in Articles 67 to 70, 89, 92 and 96 of Directive 2014/25/EU, the standard forms set out in Annexes IV to XI, XVII and XIX to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "16766a0fb39fb3e887447d6bb4f854137547b625b66d8f76b129ad01ef2b7cb6",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 1041,
        "end": 1309
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_3",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_3",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 3",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting authorities and contracting entities shall use, for the publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union* of the notices referred to in Articles 30, 52 and the second indent of Article 60(4) of Directive 2009/81/EC, the standard forms set out in Annexes XIII to XVI to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "14f5a0db4125c0f3e24f60aea11e50e4de89411facd1d3dd6d88bbb91bc4e509",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 1346,
        "end": 1653
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_4",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_4",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 4",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting authorities and contracting entities shall use, for the publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union* of the notices referred to in Articles 31, 32 and 43 of Directive 2014/23/EU, the standard forms set out in Annexes XI, ►C1 XVII** ◄ **, XX, XXI and XXII to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "2ed1c953a008829cc0340d1762ec9765275c21138b5b10cba0823db57f293519",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 1690,
        "end": 1991
      },
      "citations": [
        {
          "href": "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/32015R1986R%2802%29",
          "text": "►C1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_5",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_5",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 5",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting authorities and contracting entities shall use, for the publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union* of the notice referred to in the second indent of Article 2d(4) of Directives 89/665/EEC and 92/13/EEC, the standard form set out in Annex XII to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "807f183928bb49377475ff2024ec25b7b74038f1667fa38e4431b3d1f5255596",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 2028,
        "end": 2318
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_6",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_6",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 6",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Contracting authorities and contracting entities shall transmit the forms to the Publications Office of the European Union by electronic means, using either the eNotices online application or the TED eSender system.",
      "text_sha256": "a8d02ad34d0004347197e52ba0c516ad51f74afcc49925f54b8b34d677f4a77d",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 2355,
        "end": 2570
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_7",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_7",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 7",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "The following standard forms are established:\n\nList of standard forms\n\n| Standard form 1 | : | ‘Prior information notice’: Annex I |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 2 | : | ‘Contract notice’: Annex II |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 3 | : | ‘Contract award notice’: Annex III |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 4 | : | ‘Periodic indicative notice — Utilities’: Annex IV |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 5 | : | ‘Contract notice — Utilities’: Annex V |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 6 | : | ‘Contract award notice — Utilities’: Annex VI |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 7 | : | ‘Qualification system — Utilities’: Annex VII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 8 | : | ‘Notice on a buyer profile’: Annex VIII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 12 | : | ‘Design contest notice’: Annex IX |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 13 | : | ‘Results of design contest’: Annex X |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 14 | : | ‘Corrigendum’: Annex XI |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 15 | : | ‘Voluntary *ex ante* transparency notice’: Annex XII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 16 | : | ‘Prior information notice — Defence and Security’: Annex XIII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 17 | : | ‘Contract notice — Defence and Security’: Annex XIV |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 18 | : | ‘Contract award notice — Defence and Security’: Annex XV |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 19 | : | ‘Subcontract notice — Defence and Security’: Annex XVI |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 20 | : | ‘Modification notice’: Annex XVII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 21 | : | ‘Social and other specific services — Public contracts’: Annex XVIII |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 22 | : | ‘Social and other specific services — Utilities’: Annex XIX |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 23 | : | ‘Social and other specific services — Concessions’: Annex XX |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 24 | : | ‘Concession notice’: Annex XXI |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Standard form 25 | : | ‘Concession award notice’: Annex XXII |\n| --- | --- | --- |",
      "text_sha256": "becece3824b0ec1d31d34f69a985665947521fd69a89cffeae98847a0abccabc",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 2607,
        "end": 4712
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_8",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_8",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 8",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Implementing Regulation (EU) No 842/2011 is repealed with effect from 18 April 2016.",
      "text_sha256": "a0e740c00b90941b4580715bea1b2253dd83014b73b94323fac92574bcbd428b",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 4749,
        "end": 4833
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_9",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32015r1986:2015-11-12--0c63e506f9547ac64a0bdb1fc61046282b2ab5f4f9a48e6faa064301e459a5d9#art_9",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": "Article 9",
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "This Regulation shall enter into force on the twentieth day following that of its publication in the *Official Journal of the European Union*.\n\nArticle 3 shall apply from 18 April 2016.\n\nThis Regulation shall be binding in its entirety and directly applicable in all Member States.",
      "text_sha256": "8c652879673b3b5155f850e49a4dba57d97944b55f946c8f6a2f324b533f11cf",
      "md_span": {
